    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hi guys, I am the dev for this game and I just published my very first game. I don't have any prior experience with game development but I tried my best to bring the game that hopefully suits everyone taste. This is still an early version and there are many plans for update. Please enjoy.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set in a Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is  about the player being reincarnated into another world. The new world has monsters, humans etc. The goal of the game is to climb to the top of the dungeon tower in <strong>100 days</strong>. Manage your time, level up, train your stats or work to earn extra money. Will you finally be the one to climb to the top and claim the title of the strongest?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All About Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire system is based on Cards. Meaning that the stronger the cards you have, the better the chance for your survival. There are more than 20 Attack Cards and many more will be updated in the future version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/1d67e865b7878952b040d04d0854fdcc.poster.avif?t=1732358255\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/1d67e865b7878952b040d04d0854fdcc.webm?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/1d67e865b7878952b040d04d0854fdcc.mp4?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rival System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a rival for you to compete against in the game. The rival will also be climbing the tower on his own and try to reach the top. There is also a chance that you two might encounter each other on some floor and have to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/103eea03a8a08bcb1af4a5c55522fc6f.poster.avif?t=1732358255\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/103eea03a8a08bcb1af4a5c55522fc6f.webm?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dojo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you get tired of getting defeated and don't want to level up? You can go train in the dojo.<br>But beware there are mini-games for each of the stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/2e317ba1436a186b9e76410c636bfa05.poster.avif?t=1732358255\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/2e317ba1436a186b9e76410c636bfa05.webm?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/2e317ba1436a186b9e76410c636bfa05.mp4?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple bosses stopping you from reaching you to the top.\u00a0 Each with their own Territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Day/Night System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is constantly advancing based on your actions. If the player decides to keep climbing the tower during night time, there will be bigger challenges for him/her but the rewards will be better. Do you still dare to climb the tower then?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeated!! Not a Problem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being defeated is not a thing to be afraid in the game. Once you have defeated, you will start from the beginning of the dungeon floor again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/180b290e0be3dad1740c3dbaddf412fa.poster.avif?t=1732358255\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/180b290e0be3dad1740c3dbaddf412fa.apng?t=1732358255\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hi guys, I am the dev for this game and I just published my very first game. I don't have any prior experience with game development but I tried my best to bring the game that hopefully suits everyone taste. This is still an early version and there are many plans for update. Please enjoy.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set in a Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is  about the player being reincarnated into another world. The new world has monsters, humans etc. The goal of the game is to climb to the top of the dungeon tower in <strong>100 days</strong>. Manage your time, level up, train your stats or work to earn extra money. Will you finally be the one to climb to the top and claim the title of the strongest?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All About Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire system is based on Cards. Meaning that the stronger the cards you have, the better the chance for your survival. There are more than 20 Attack Cards and many more will be updated in the future version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/1d67e865b7878952b040d04d0854fdcc.poster.avif?t=1732358255\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/1d67e865b7878952b040d04d0854fdcc.webm?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/1d67e865b7878952b040d04d0854fdcc.mp4?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rival System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a rival for you to compete against in the game. The rival will also be climbing the tower on his own and try to reach the top. There is also a chance that you two might encounter each other on some floor and have to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/103eea03a8a08bcb1af4a5c55522fc6f.poster.avif?t=1732358255\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/103eea03a8a08bcb1af4a5c55522fc6f.webm?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dojo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you get tired of getting defeated and don't want to level up? You can go train in the dojo.<br>But beware there are mini-games for each of the stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/2e317ba1436a186b9e76410c636bfa05.poster.avif?t=1732358255\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/2e317ba1436a186b9e76410c636bfa05.webm?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/2e317ba1436a186b9e76410c636bfa05.mp4?t=1732358255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple bosses stopping you from reaching you to the top.\u00a0 Each with their own Territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Day/Night System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is constantly advancing based on your actions. If the player decides to keep climbing the tower during night time, there will be bigger challenges for him/her but the rewards will be better. Do you still dare to climb the tower then?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeated!! Not a Problem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being defeated is not a thing to be afraid in the game. Once you have defeated, you will start from the beginning of the dungeon floor again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/180b290e0be3dad1740c3dbaddf412fa.poster.avif?t=1732358255\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299520/extras/180b290e0be3dad1740c3dbaddf412fa.apng?t=1732358255\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span></p>",
